     type.  Alternatively MMeemmGGuuaarrdd can take over uummaa__zzaalllloocc(),
     uummaa__zzaalllloocc__aarrgg() and uummaa__ffrreeee() for a single uma(9) zone.  Also MMeemmGGuuaarrdd
     can guard all allocations larger than PAGE_SIZE, and can guard a random
     fraction of all allocations.  There is also a knob to prevent allocations
     smaller than a specified size from being guarded, to limit memory waste.

